{"3685330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Orbifold", "steam_appid": 3685330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685330/extras/5c7017d1a4b16399af3747aeb64f557a.poster.avif?t=1773724767\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685330/extras/5c7017d1a4b16399af3747aeb64f557a.webm?t=1773724767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Eyes Up, Soldier</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the Spheres, hollow pockets of the old world still crawling with the denizens of a planetary war. Battle your way through autonomous Husks to reach a distant distress call - and uncover the mystery behind the Inversion Event.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A series of mind-bending levels are handcrafted to encourage exploration and creative combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685330/extras/54031828074986b8320418f3dc4b710d.poster.avif?t=1773724767\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685330/extras/54031828074986b8320418f3dc4b710d.webm?t=1773724767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight Together</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with friends online or on LAN. Assemble your squad from a collection of unlikely allies: Explorers, soldiers and double agents. Or trek through the Spheres alone, finding powerful weapons and countless stacking upgrades to hold your edge against the militant horde.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your weapon loaded and your head on a swivel in this frantic first-person-shooter experience that rewards skill and precision.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685330/extras/71a9aee6a2b106fa27d7794ddc84fcba.poster.avif?t=1773724767\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685330/extras/71a9aee6a2b106fa27d7794ddc84fcba.webm?t=1773724767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>No Two Excursions The Same</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buildcrafting and procedural elements make every run dynamic and fresh. Will you find the perfect weapons and artifacts this time? Or will you have to adapt - and in the process, discover something new?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685330/extras/7ce63bc9a5df69b2c42cf336f3ba64f4.poster.avif?t=1773724767\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685330/extras/7ce63bc9a5df69b2c42cf336f3ba64f4.webm?t=1773724767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Under Construction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orbifold is still in active development. In the meantime, please consider wishlisting the game and joining our socials to  follow development!  </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685330/extras/5c7017d1a4b16399af3747aeb64f557a.poster.avif?t=1773724767\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685330/extras/5c7017d1a4b16399af3747aeb64f557a.webm?t=1773724767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Eyes Up, Soldier</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the Spheres, hollow pockets of the old world still crawling with the denizens of a planetary war. Battle your way through autonomous Husks to reach a distant distress call - and uncover the mystery behind the Inversion Event.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A series of mind-bending levels are handcrafted to encourage exploration and creative combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685330/extras/54031828074986b8320418f3dc4b710d.poster.avif?t=1773724767\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685330/extras/54031828074986b8320418f3dc4b710d.webm?t=1773724767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight Together</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with friends online or on LAN. Assemble your squad from a collection of unlikely allies: Explorers, soldiers and double agents. Or trek through the Spheres alone, finding powerful weapons and countless stacking upgrades to hold your edge against the militant horde.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your weapon loaded and your head on a swivel in this frantic first-person-shooter experience that rewards skill and precision.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685330/extras/71a9aee6a2b106fa27d7794ddc84fcba.poster.avif?t=1773724767\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685330/extras/71a9aee6a2b106fa27d7794ddc84fcba.webm?t=1773724767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>No Two Excursions The Same</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buildcrafting and procedural elements make every run dynamic and fresh. Will you find the perfect weapons and artifacts this time? Or will you have to adapt - and in the process, discover something new?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685330/extras/7ce63bc9a5df69b2c42cf336f3ba64f4.poster.avif?t=1773724767\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685330/extras/7ce63bc9a5df69b2c42cf336f3ba64f4.webm?t=1773724767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Under Construction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orbifold is still in active development. In the meantime, please consider wishlisting the game and joining our socials to  follow development!  </p>", "short_description": "Fight through mind-bending spherical arenas on your own or with friends. Scavenge for weapons, loot and creative upgrades in the twisted remnants of a broken planet. A warped world of inverted mayhem awaits.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685330/ba60f3a1ab32b9955798e65ae9c10a6a71df2847/header.jpg?t=1773724767", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685330/2c6db6b1b5ef13a7976475b866aecc49fdda1f0b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773724767", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685330/2c6db6b1b5ef13a7976475b866aecc49fdda1f0b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773724767", "website": "https://wildvectorgames.nz/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb